    "story": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/739206f9-f712-48a3-860b-c1fcb25f2488.jpg",
        "eyebrow": "Our story",
        "heading": "Meet the faces behind Dog Barn Yorkshire",
        "text": "<p>We're Paul and Bobbi — and our trio of cavapoochons, Honey, Dora and Bertie. Our brand is built from the heart, driven by our love for dogs, Paul's deep-rooted love for Yorkshire and the countryside life we adore.</p>",
